sequenceDiagram
    title Sequence Feature Coverage
    actor U as User
    participant API as Public API
    participant W as Worker Service
    participant DB as Database

    Note right of U: User starts the workflow<br/>from the published UI
    U->>+API: Submit job request
    API->>+W: Start processing
    Note over API,W: Request and worker stay active<br/>while the job is running

    alt Job can be processed
        W->>DB: Insert pending record
        DB-->>W: Record stored
        loop Poll until complete
            W->>W: Check job state
        end
        rect rgba(230, 245, 255, 0.5) Highlight response window
            W-->>-API: Job completed
        end
        API-->>-U: Success response
    else Validation failed
        API-->>U: Validation error
    end

    Note left of DB: Storage note<br/>kept outside the fragment